{% comment %}
  4.0商详页（PDP）图片卡片
  说明：
  1.区分PC和Mobile图片配置与显示；
  2.支持图片为空时留白显示。

  接收参数:
    - cardTitle: {String?} 卡片标题用作图片alt保底文案
    - pcEmptyShowBlank: {Bollean} PC端图片为空留白展示
    - pcImg: {image_picker} PC端图片
    - pcWidth: {Number} PC端图片自定义宽度
    - pcHeight: {Number} PC端图片自定义高度
    - mbEmptyShowBlank: {Bollean} 移动端图片为空留白展示
    - mbImg: {image_picker} 移动端图片
    - mbWidth: {Number} 移动端图片自定义宽度
    - mbHeight: {Number} 移动端图片自定义高度

  示例:
  {% render 'pdp-picture-card',
    cardTitle: settings.title,
    pcEmptyShowBlank: true,
    pcImg: settings.pcImg,
    pcWidth: 1920,
    pcHeight: 560,
    mbEmptyShowBlank: true,
    mbImg: settings.mbImg,
    mbWidth: 750,
    mbHeight: 800
  %}
{% endcomment %}

{% if pcEmptyShowBlank or pcImg != blank %}
  {% if pcImg.alt != blank %}
    {% assign img_alt = pcImg.alt -%}
  {%- else %}
    {% assign img_alt = cardTitle | strip_html | escape %}
  {% endif %}
  <picture class="pc-show">
    {% if pcImg != blank %}
      <source
        media="(min-width: 1024px)"
        srcset="{{ pcImg | image_url:width: pcWidth,height: pcHeight }}"
      >
    {% else %}
      <source
        media="(min-width: 1024px)"
        srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw=="
      >
    {% endif %}

    <img
      loading="lazy"
      alt="{{ img_alt }}"
      width="{{ pcImg.width | default: pcWidth}}"
      height="{{ pcImg.height | default:pcHeight}}"
    >
  </picture>
{% endif %}

{% if mbEmptyShowBlank or mbImg != blank %}
  {% if mbImg.alt != blank %}
    {% assign img_alt = mbImg.alt %}
  {% else %}
    {% assign img_alt = cardTitle | strip_html | escape %}
  {% endif %}
  <picture class="mb-show">
    {% if mbImg != blank %}
      <source
        media="(max-width: 1023.98px)"
        srcset="{{ mbImg | image_url:width:mbWidth,height:mbHeight }}"
      >
    {% else %}
      <source
        media="(max-width: 1023.98px)"
        srcset="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw=="
      >
    {% endif %}
    <img
      alt="{{ img_alt}}"
      loading="lazy"
      width="{{ mbImg.width | default:mbWidth}}"
      height="{{ mbImg.height | default:mbHeight}}"
    >
  </picture>
{% endif %}